<title>UK: IBCA rates DSL Bank 300 bln lire notes at AAA.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates DSL Bank 300 bln lire notes at AAA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Friday it had assigned an AAA rating to Deutsche Siedlungs- und Landesrentenbank's 300 billion lire 6.875 percent note issue due 2007.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of DSL Bank,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
</text>
